# Deepway Navigator (a 2/2 Merfolk Wizard, flash): "When this creature enters, untap each other Merfolk you control." and "As long as you
# attacked with three or more Merfolk this turn, Merfolk you control get +1/+0." Turn 1 Bot1 casts three Coral Merfolk (2/1) and Bot2
# one of their own on turn 2. On turn 3 all three attack with no Navigator out yet (2/1 each); after combat the flashed-in Navigator is a 3/2,
# the bonus applies to the Merfolk already there (3/1) since the condition looks back at the turn (the opponent's Coral Merfolk stays a
# 2/1: only Merfolk "you control") and its entry untaps the three tapped attackers. The Mox Jet tapped before combat stays tapped: only Merfolk untap.

